{"meta":{"ui":"plan_progress","model":"claude-haiku-5-5","form":"notation","turn":"generate","prompt":"Show the plan for migrating my blog as steps: six steps with a short description each. A start button runs them one after another (a second or two each) with a spinner on the running step, ticks on the finished ones, a progress bar and the time elapsed, a pause button, and a summary when all are done.","text":"I'll build this with a state for each step's status, a running flag, elapsed seconds, and a done count. Steps advance via the app, which emits events; each step's status shows a spinner, tick, or dot.\n\nstate running=false\nstate paused=false\nstate elapsed=0\nstate done=0\nstate step1=\"pending\"\nstate step2=\"pending\"\nstate step3=\"pending\"\nstate step4=\"pending\"\nstate step5=\"pending\"\nstate step6=\"pending\"\nCard gap:12 w:390\n  Text.title \"Blog migration\"\n  Progress =done\n  Row between\n    Text.muted \"Elapsed: {elapsed}s\"\n    Text.muted \"{done} of 6 steps\"\n  Row gap:8\n    Button.primary \"Start\" -> running=true; paused=false; emit start\n    Button.outline \"Pause\" -> paused=!paused; emit pause\n  Divider\n  Row gap:12\n    if step1==\"running\"\n      CircularProgressIndicator\n    if step1==\"done\"\n      Icon \"check\"\n    if step1==\"pending\"\n      Icon \"radio_button_unchecked\"\n    Column gap:2 grow\n      Text.strong \"1. Export posts\"\n      Text.muted \"Pull all posts and drafts from the current platform.\"\n  Row gap:12\n    if step2==\"running\"\n      CircularProgressIndicator\n    if step2==\"done\"\n      Icon \"check\"\n    if step2==\"pending\"\n      Icon \"radio_button_unchecked\"\n    Column gap:2 grow\n      Text.strong \"2. Convert formatting\"\n      Text.muted \"Turn exported HTML and shortcodes into Markdown.\"\n  Row gap:12\n    if step3==\"running\"\n      CircularProgressIndicator\n    if step3==\"done\"\n      Icon \"check\"\n    if step3==\"pending\"\n      Icon \"radio_button_unchecked\"\n    Column gap:2 grow\n      Text.strong \"3. Move images\"\n      Text.muted \"Download media and upload it to the new host.\"\n  Row gap:12\n    if step4==\"running\"\n      CircularProgressIndicator\n    if step4==\"done\"\n      Icon \"check\"\n    if step4==\"pending\"\n      Icon \"radio_button_unchecked\"\n    Column gap:2 grow\n      Text.strong \"4. Fix links\"\n      Text.muted \"Rewrite internal URLs to point at the new addresses.\"\n  Row gap:12\n    if step5==\"running\"\n      CircularProgressIndicator\n    if step5==\"done\"\n      Icon \"check\"\n    if step5==\"pending\"\n      Icon \"radio_button_unchecked\"\n    Column gap:2 grow\n      Text.strong \"5. Restore redirects\"\n      Text.muted \"Add redirects from old post addresses so links keep working.\"\n  Row gap:12\n    if step6==\"running\"\n      CircularProgressIndicator\n    if step6==\"done\"\n      Icon \"check\"\n    if step6==\"pending\"\n      Icon \"radio_button_unchecked\"\n    Column gap:2 grow\n      Text.strong \"6. Verify and publish\"\n      Text.muted \"Check every page renders, then switch the domain over.\"\n  if done==6\n    Divider\n    Badge.success \"Migration complete\"\n    Text.body \"All 6 steps finished in {elapsed} seconds. Your blog is live on the new host.\"","usage":{"input_tokens":1701,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1079,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard","output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0}},"ttftMs":508,"totalMs":4713}}
